#: ../../source/docs/common-piksi-multi-rtk-receiver.rst:5
#: 280f003a9a00464a92422d6585578cad
msgid "Swift Navigation's Piksi Multi RTK GPS Receiver"
msgstr "Swift Navigation 的 Piksi Multi RTK GPS 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-piksi-multi-rtk-receiver.rst:7
#: 430b7274933e48869ca0f35ecf6b2c5d
msgid ""
"This article provides a brief overview of Piksi Multi multi-band multi-"
"constellation RTK GPS receiver, available from `Swift Navigation "
"<https://www.swiftnav.com/>`__."
msgstr ""
"本文简要介绍 Piksi Multi 多频段多星座 RTK GPS 接收机，可从 `Swift Navigation "
"<https://www.swiftnav.com/>`__ 获得。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-piksi-multi-rtk-receiver.rst:14
#: 651db8ba8ef74f98b0ade302b7cfe6f4
msgid ""
"The previous offering from Swift Navigation, Piksi v2, is still supported by"
" ArduPilot. That being said, Swift has announced Piksi v2's end-of-life, and"
" new units are no longer available. Deprecated integration documentation for"
" Piksi v2 is `available here "
"<http://docs.swiftnav.com/wiki/Integrating_Piksi_with_the_Pixhawk_platform>`__."
msgstr ""
"Swift Navigation 的上一代产品 Piksi v2 仍受 ArduPilot 支持。尽管如此，Swift 已宣布 Piksi v2 "
"停产，新设备不再供货。Piksi v2 的已弃用集成文档 `请参见此处 "
"<http://docs.swiftnav.com/wiki/Integrating_Piksi_with_the_Pixhawk_platform>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-piksi-multi-rtk-receiver.rst:17
#: e53df9e4c3604d8e8aeba908a6371f36
msgid "What is Piksi Multi?"
msgstr "什么是 Piksi Multi？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-piksi-multi-rtk-receiver.rst:19
#: 38e19d06e35f445a896a984eb2146efc
msgid ""
"Piksi Multi the first affordable multi-band multi-constellation RTK GPS "
"unit. Not only does it provide centimeter-accurate positioning similar to "
"other RTK GPS units, it additionally provides RTK lock times on the order of"
" seconds. In comparison, single-frequency RTK GPS receivers require several "
"minutes to acquire or reacquire an RTK FIX."
msgstr ""
"Piksi Multi 是第一款经济实惠的多频段多星座 RTK GPS 设备。它不仅提供与其他 RTK GPS "
"设备类似的厘米级定位精度，还能在秒级时间内实现 RTK 锁定。相比之下，单频 RTK GPS 接收机需要数分钟才能获取或重新获取 RTK FIX。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-piksi-multi-rtk-receiver.rst:22
#: 6037ee62ee334b9498abe2e708097543
msgid "What is RTK GPS and why does multi-frequency matter?"
msgstr "什么是 RTK GPS，为什么多频段很重要？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-piksi-multi-rtk-receiver.rst:24
#: ccd2ab0520d44245b951b4d466e3e829
msgid ""
"Real-time Kinematic GPS is a signal processing technique that improves the "
"accuracy of a GPS receiver by removing sources of error through comparison "
"with a second GPS receiver. Real-time kinematic (RTK) GPS exploits "
"information about the GPS carrier wave to improve the accuracy of position "
"estimates. RTK GPS compares the phase of the received carrier wave between "
"two GPS receivers to derive an accurate vector between a stationary base "
"station GPS and moving rover GPS. Note the requirement for two GPS "
"receivers, in comparison to conventional GPS positioning that requires only "
"a single receiver. This approach can provide centimeter-accurate positioning"
" with millisecond latencies."
msgstr ""
"实时动态 GPS 是一种信号处理技术，通过与第二个 GPS 接收机比较消除误差源，从而提高 GPS 接收机的精度。实时动态（RTK）GPS 利用 GPS"
" 载波波形的信息来提高位置估算的精度。RTK GPS 通过比较两个 GPS 接收机之间接收到的载波波相位，推导出固定基站 GPS 和移动漫游 GPS "
"之间的精确向量。请注意，这需要两个 GPS 接收机，而传统 GPS 定位只需要一个接收机。这种方法可以提供毫秒级延迟的厘米级定位精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-piksi-multi-rtk-receiver.rst:26
#: 07f50058380f489d95c5b32235d301b9
msgid ""
"However, RTK GPS can only calculate centimeter-accurate positions once an "
"integer ambiguity is resolved. For single-frequency receivers, ambiguity "
"resolution algorithms have runtimes on the order of minutes. Multi-frequency"
" receivers can additionally exploit information contained in the difference "
"between the two frequencies. This insight allows Piksi Multi and other "
"multi-frequency receivers to achieve RTK fixes in seconds."
msgstr ""
"然而，RTK GPS "
"只有在解决整周模糊度后才能计算厘米级精度的位置。对于单频接收机，模糊度解算算法的运行时间为分钟级。多频接收机还可以利用两个频率之间差值中包含的信息。这种洞察力使"
" Piksi Multi 和其他多频接收机能够在几秒钟内实现 RTK 锁定。"

